Description:It is your second main phase. You control Mogg Fanatic and have Fling in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 1 life and controls Cursed Totem (activated abilities of creatures can't be activated). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-cursed-totem-spell-cost | Cursed Totem stops only activated abilities of creatures (CR 602.5); sacrificing a creature to pay a spell's cost is not activating its ability (CR 601.2h): Mogg Fanatic's own ability can't be activated, but Fling can sacrifice it for 1
